# Fine-Tuned Text-to-SQL Assistant (QLoRA) with Safe LLM Serving

An end-to-end Text-to-SQL system with QLoRA fine-tuning, GGUF quantization, and a read-only SQL safety layer.

## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
# On Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
pip install -e .
```

## Commands

- `make test` : Run pytest test suite
- `make lint` : Run ruff lint checks
- `make serve` : Start FastAPI serving backend
- `make ui` : Start Streamlit UI
